Perfect for private events, parties, and corporate gatherings, our catering creates a memorable dining experience your guests will love.",[211,215],{"name":212,"image":78,"video":213,"link":79,"title":212,"description":214},"Live paella cooking","/videos/paella.mp4","Enjoy authentic Spanish paella prepared live at your event. Our chefs cook fresh ingredients on-site, creating a delicious dish and a memorable experience for your guests. 🍤🥘",{"name":216,"image":217,"link":89,"title":216,"description":218},"Tapas catering","/images/services/tapas.jpg","Offer a wide selection of traditional Spanish tapas, perfect for sharing and enjoying with drinks. From classic patatas bravas to Iberian ham and cheese platters, our tapas bring the authentic flavors of Spain to your event. 🍢🇪🇸",{"title":220,"description":221,"ctaText":20,"ctaLink":21,"list":222},"Flower Decoration","Transform your space with our stunning flower decoration services. From elegant bouquets to elaborate installations, we create beautiful floral arrangements that add a touch of nature and sophistication to any event. Perfect for weddings, parties, and special occasions.",[223],{"name":224,"image":225,"link":89,"title":224,"description":226},"Event installations","/images/services/flowers.jpg","Custom floral installations designed to enhance your event space. From centerpieces to backdrops, we create stunning displays that leave a lasting impression.",{"title":228,"description":229,"ctaText":20,"ctaLink":21,"list":230},"Photography","Capture your special moments with our professional photography services. From portraits to events, we create stunning images that tell your story. Perfect for weddings, parties, and special occasions.",[231],{"name":232,"image":233,"link":89,"title":232,"description":234},"Event photography","/images/services/photo.jpg","Custom event photography designed to enhance your event space. From centerpieces to backdrops, we create stunning displays that leave a lasting impression.",tru